---
source: crates/cli/tests/it/render.rs
expression: overlapping
---
--- human (exit 0)
daemon
  ! not running (socket \\.\pipe\devlanes-0)
    fix: devlanes start, or devlanes daemon restart
sandbox
  ✓ not sandboxed
ports
  ! ports.range 20000-32767 overlaps ports Windows reserves (27339, 32700-32799); a service given one of them cannot bind it
    fix: set ports.range in ~/.devlanes/config.yaml clear of them (netsh int ipv4 show excludedportrange protocol=tcp lists them; Hyper-V, WSL and Docker Desktop reserve them)
  ! box ports 27339, 32701 are inside port ranges Windows reserves; they cannot be mirrored here
    fix: set ports.range on the box clear of the reserved ranges, then restart its lanes (netsh int ipv4 show excludedportrange protocol=tcp lists them)
output
  ✓ mode human (DEVLANES_OUTPUT)
